WEBVTT

00:14.510 --> 00:17.460
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.640 --> 00:21.300
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:21.300 --> 00:26.700
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:28.180 --> 00:31.730
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:32.270 --> 00:36.560
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.520 --> 00:41.070
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:42.060 --> 00:44.270
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:44.270 --> 00:47.310
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:47.310 --> 00:49.390
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:49.390 --> 00:53.460
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.970 --> 00:58.740
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.740 --> 01:03.020
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:03.020 --> 01:04.430
♪Over the time♪

01:04.430 --> 01:06.450
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.450 --> 01:09.300
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:09.300 --> 01:12.560
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.560 --> 01:17.260
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.970 --> 01:25.620
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:38.289 --> 01:43.650
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.979 --> 01:47.180
=Episode 2=

01:47.720 --> 01:49.120
See?

01:50.000 --> 01:51.479
Only the true Lord Ming

01:51.800 --> 01:53.560
can make these soul fish ascend.

01:54.080 --> 01:56.039
She is the omnipotent

01:56.200 --> 01:59.320
and omniscient Lord Ming.

01:59.759 --> 02:00.360
Shut up.

02:01.000 --> 02:02.480
Or I'll kill you both.

02:03.040 --> 02:03.920
What is the Qiyuan Orb?

02:04.640 --> 02:05.440
Where did it come from?

02:06.160 --> 02:08.199
It is from human sacrifices...

02:09.199 --> 02:09.840
Lord Ming.

02:14.960 --> 02:15.800
Don't try to hurt Qi.

02:16.000 --> 02:17.920
They called her Lord Ming.

02:18.120 --> 02:19.240
Didn't you hear it?

02:19.360 --> 02:20.320
She is not Lord Ming.

02:20.520 --> 02:21.520
Seeing is believing.

02:21.880 --> 02:23.200
You're refusing to face the truth.

02:24.440 --> 02:26.400
Out of my way.
I don't harm the innocent.

02:27.000 --> 02:27.920
She is innocent.

02:28.320 --> 02:29.000
Is she?

02:29.320 --> 02:30.600
The Qiyuan Sect harms the civilians.

02:30.680 --> 02:31.640
Is she innocent then?

02:34.520 --> 02:35.320
Sir.

02:35.960 --> 02:36.360
Let's go.

02:36.360 --> 02:37.320
But Lord Ming…

02:37.400 --> 02:38.760
Inform Shengxuan of this. Go.

02:38.760 --> 02:39.280
Shengxuan?

02:39.640 --> 02:40.160
- Move.
- Okay.

02:40.160 --> 02:40.800
Inform him of this.

02:54.880 --> 02:56.760
Yue Jinzhao, if you don't stop,

02:56.800 --> 02:57.680
I will not give you mercy.

02:57.920 --> 02:59.560
My family will never associate
with evil people.

02:59.840 --> 03:01.280
If you try to harm Qi,

03:01.680 --> 03:02.680
you'll have to kill me first.

03:18.160 --> 03:19.480
Move aside. I don't want to kill you.

03:19.960 --> 03:21.360
You claim to be righteous.

03:22.000 --> 03:23.400
Then prove that she is the Lord Ming.

03:23.920 --> 03:25.440
She has consumed those evil beings.
Isn't that a proof?

03:26.280 --> 03:27.840
Do you have any evidence
against my judgment?

03:28.079 --> 03:28.840
If she were Lord Ming,

03:30.560 --> 03:32.400
how could she take action
against the Qiyuan Sect?

03:39.760 --> 03:40.480
Let me save her.

03:52.160 --> 03:52.640
Thank you.

04:30.160 --> 04:32.880
Qi.

04:34.640 --> 04:35.440
I am Jinzhao.

04:37.240 --> 04:37.600
Qi.

04:38.920 --> 04:40.040
Can you hear me?

04:53.280 --> 04:54.480
Jinzhao didn't ignore me.

04:54.760 --> 04:56.280
All of you, get away from me.

05:16.720 --> 05:17.680
Jinzhao.

05:22.520 --> 05:23.360
(The Kun Clan)

05:24.120 --> 05:25.000
(never shed tears.)

05:26.520 --> 05:27.720
(But she's crying.)

05:28.480 --> 05:29.120
Qi.

05:30.320 --> 05:31.120
I am Jinzhao.

05:32.480 --> 05:33.000
Qi.

05:34.400 --> 05:35.720
Can you hear me?

05:36.920 --> 05:37.800
I am Jinzhao.

05:39.360 --> 05:40.120
Jinzhao.

05:42.760 --> 05:44.560
Jinzhao doesn't abandon me.

05:50.000 --> 05:53.000
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

05:54.220 --> 05:56.680
♪Without regrets♪

05:56.680 --> 06:02.120
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

06:03.720 --> 06:07.850
♪If you decide to let your guard down♪

06:07.850 --> 06:12.040
♪You might fall for the wrong one♪

06:15.360 --> 06:15.960
Jinzhao.

06:17.560 --> 06:19.880
Jinzhao, I don't want
to stay here anymore.

06:21.360 --> 06:22.000
Qi.

06:23.050 --> 06:24.940
♪We have different paths and goals♪

06:24.940 --> 06:28.810
♪But I have no regrets♪

06:29.450 --> 06:34.180
♪Because you're an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

06:36.000 --> 06:36.520
Qi.

06:38.409 --> 06:39.690
♪Over time♪

06:39.690 --> 06:41.420
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

06:41.960 --> 06:42.280
Qi.

06:45.030 --> 06:48.100
♪Be with you forever♪

06:48.100 --> 06:50.950
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

06:51.600 --> 06:52.320
I am Jinzhao.

06:53.320 --> 06:54.080
Jinzhao.

06:55.400 --> 06:56.240
I am so hungry.

06:56.800 --> 06:58.960
Okay, I'll take you back
to eat noodles right away.

07:02.200 --> 07:03.320
It's really you.

07:03.920 --> 07:05.920
You don't let me eat eggs.

07:07.590 --> 07:12.650
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

07:13.880 --> 07:15.000
I need to take her to the physician.

07:15.360 --> 07:15.960
Don't worry.

07:16.280 --> 07:17.920
I have a doctor with me.

07:18.400 --> 07:20.040
But you two can't move around
for the time being

07:21.450 --> 07:23.050
♪I will protect you in my life♪

07:23.050 --> 07:28.740
♪That's my love for you♪

07:32.960 --> 07:34.120
(Qi cried today.)

07:36.040 --> 07:37.360
(Is it because of Yue Jinzhao?)

07:44.560 --> 07:44.800
Come.

07:47.800 --> 07:48.720
Lord Shengxuan.

07:49.680 --> 07:50.159
Kneel.

07:53.360 --> 07:54.040
Lord Shengxuan.

07:54.800 --> 07:56.400
I'm to blame.

07:56.840 --> 07:58.680
Meng Cheng is incompetent.

07:59.080 --> 08:00.040
Well,

08:00.280 --> 08:01.920
those two guys got away.

08:02.320 --> 08:04.920
And Fujin Hall is exposed.

08:05.760 --> 08:07.320
Fujin Hall can't serve as a stronghold.

08:08.240 --> 08:11.200
You guys go to the sub-branch
in Luori Village and lay low.

08:12.160 --> 08:12.600
Yes.

08:12.760 --> 08:13.160
Yes.

08:14.600 --> 08:14.960
Get out.

08:17.520 --> 08:18.280
Out of here.

08:23.200 --> 08:23.840
Lord Shengxuan.

08:24.520 --> 08:26.240
There is one thing
I still don't understand.

08:27.120 --> 08:29.520
The girl called Qi…

08:30.160 --> 08:31.400
Is she really the Ming Lord?

08:32.120 --> 08:32.799
What about it?

08:34.240 --> 08:34.919
Any problems?

08:36.320 --> 08:37.559
No,

08:37.640 --> 08:38.640
I don't have any problems.

08:40.200 --> 08:41.440
I shall take my leave

08:42.559 --> 08:43.400
and set off immediately.

08:52.720 --> 08:53.520
(Qi.)

08:54.240 --> 08:55.080
(Yue Jinzhao.)

08:55.080 --> 08:56.320
(Fujin Hall Book)

08:56.320 --> 08:58.000
(I'll wait for you at Luori Village.)

09:15.320 --> 09:15.680
No.

09:15.960 --> 09:16.600
I am not.

09:17.240 --> 09:18.320
I am not the Ming Lord.

09:23.560 --> 09:24.000
(Qi.)

09:25.320 --> 09:26.760
(Are you Lord Ming?)

09:29.840 --> 09:30.560
It doesn't matter.

09:33.440 --> 09:34.440
You are still my Qi.

09:40.840 --> 09:41.320
Yue.

09:41.960 --> 09:42.520
The doctor is here.

09:50.840 --> 09:52.640
Doctor, how is she?

09:59.720 --> 10:00.600
Well,

10:01.440 --> 10:03.600
she is unharmed.

10:04.040 --> 10:07.280
And she's energetic and in good health.

10:08.240 --> 10:09.960
How is that possible? She's unconscious.

10:12.200 --> 10:14.040
Clearly, she has fallen asleep.

10:23.960 --> 10:25.120
What?

10:31.760 --> 10:33.080
She has fallen asleep?

10:38.800 --> 10:39.680
Egg noodles.

10:40.360 --> 10:42.880
Jinzhao, don't snatch my egg noodles.

10:49.080 --> 10:50.080
I'll tell someone to cook it.

10:50.240 --> 10:50.680
Wait.

10:53.520 --> 10:54.440
I've been keeping my word

10:54.960 --> 10:56.040
all the way.

10:57.080 --> 10:57.800
So…

10:59.840 --> 11:01.160
You're indeed a man of your word.

11:01.760 --> 11:02.200
So?

11:03.280 --> 11:04.920
So, five bowls of egg noodles.

11:15.600 --> 11:16.200
No problem.

11:19.000 --> 11:19.720
Wait, Yue.

11:20.680 --> 11:24.240
I hear
you two are figuring out your origins.

11:25.200 --> 11:25.640
Yes.

11:27.600 --> 11:29.400
We woke up
in Wuyan Village three years ago.

11:29.680 --> 11:30.600
We remembered nothing

11:30.760 --> 11:31.440
but our names.

11:32.400 --> 11:33.160
At first, we thought

11:33.160 --> 11:34.640
we were no different from others.

11:35.240 --> 11:36.120
But later we discovered

11:36.800 --> 11:38.080
that we were born with martial skills.

11:38.800 --> 11:40.440
So, we want to find out who we are.

11:43.160 --> 11:44.080
Even if she is Lord Ming,

11:45.440 --> 11:47.440
it's better than not knowing

11:47.440 --> 11:48.320
where one comes from.

11:51.120 --> 11:52.960
What was the magic you used on Miss Yue

11:53.760 --> 11:55.520
today at the Fujin Hall?

11:57.920 --> 11:59.080
Over the past few years,

11:59.560 --> 12:00.720
we've been traveling.

12:02.640 --> 12:03.800
To earn some money,

12:03.800 --> 12:06.480
we have to work on that.

12:06.880 --> 12:08.880
I happened to discover

12:09.480 --> 12:10.960
we can communicate with our minds

12:11.400 --> 12:12.320
and transfer thoughts.

12:13.800 --> 12:15.920
What's this magic?

12:15.920 --> 12:17.760
I haven't really thought about it.

12:18.720 --> 12:19.640
I have an idea.

12:20.480 --> 12:22.400
How about I call it

12:22.400 --> 12:24.680
omnipotent telepathy?

12:26.160 --> 12:26.640
Where is she?

12:30.000 --> 12:31.040
She's so rude.

12:31.040 --> 12:31.840
I haven't finished yet.

12:39.120 --> 12:40.720
If they act properly,

12:41.000 --> 12:41.960
they will be my guests.

12:42.280 --> 12:42.840
Take care of them.

12:43.160 --> 12:43.920
Yes.

13:00.120 --> 13:00.440
Sit.

13:06.120 --> 13:06.680
Well,

13:07.720 --> 13:08.840
are you really feeling well?

13:09.720 --> 13:10.120
Yes.

13:13.520 --> 13:14.040
No.

13:15.680 --> 13:17.720
I feel I've become more powerful.

13:20.440 --> 13:22.560
Can you finish speaking in one go?

13:22.560 --> 13:25.480
I know you're worried about me.

13:26.400 --> 13:27.200
I'm not.

13:34.160 --> 13:35.480
Do you know that you cried today?

13:36.680 --> 13:39.120
You never shed tears before.

13:40.400 --> 13:41.200
I cried?

13:43.040 --> 13:43.960
Did you see something?

13:46.440 --> 13:47.480
Well,

13:48.160 --> 13:49.720
I was trapped in a cave.

13:50.920 --> 13:53.120
When I heard voices saying

13:53.640 --> 13:54.960
that you had abandoned me,

13:55.400 --> 13:56.600
you showed up,

13:58.000 --> 13:59.240
and I was protected.

14:09.800 --> 14:12.000
Jinzhao?

14:36.800 --> 14:37.520
You…

14:39.840 --> 14:41.680
Why are you crying again?

14:42.040 --> 14:44.800
I am hungry. I want to eat egg noodles.

14:45.320 --> 14:48.200
Can you give them all to me?

14:50.160 --> 14:51.680
Here are the egg noodles.

14:54.400 --> 14:54.880
Okay.

14:55.960 --> 14:57.480
It's all yours.

15:04.880 --> 15:06.880
(Turns out tears are this useful.)

15:42.080 --> 15:42.520
Maiming.

15:43.720 --> 15:46.680
It seems you have good news
to share with me.

15:49.240 --> 15:50.680
Today we destroyed the branch

15:50.760 --> 15:51.840
of Qiyuan Sect in Yinghui Fort.

15:52.200 --> 15:53.040
And we eliminated spoils.

15:53.960 --> 15:55.160
Other treasures

15:55.400 --> 15:56.520
will be returned tomorrow.

15:58.480 --> 16:00.800
I need you to check the account books

16:01.040 --> 16:02.600
to find out more clues.

16:04.440 --> 16:05.440
As you wish,

16:05.960 --> 16:08.960
the reputation
of your family can be spread.

16:10.360 --> 16:12.600
However, I'm not the only one

16:12.600 --> 16:13.640
who destroyed Fujin Hall.

16:14.080 --> 16:14.960
Two more people helped.

16:22.720 --> 16:23.760
Jinzhao.

16:24.600 --> 16:27.080
why could I consume the Qiyuan Orb?

16:28.000 --> 16:30.240
And why did I see the past?

16:30.320 --> 16:33.160
Where did the strange voice come from?

16:36.040 --> 16:36.680
Alright.

16:38.800 --> 16:40.120
One day, we will figure it out.

16:43.280 --> 16:45.160
Am I really Lord Ming?

16:46.280 --> 16:47.600
Of course not.

16:48.880 --> 16:50.280
Along the way,

16:50.720 --> 16:52.160
we haven't done many good deeds,

16:52.640 --> 16:54.360
but we haven't done anything bad.

16:54.760 --> 16:55.400
Don't be silly.

16:56.200 --> 16:57.160
If you were Lord Ming,

16:57.160 --> 16:59.000
my name would be Zhaojin.

17:02.120 --> 17:04.400
Jinzhao? Zhaojin?

17:05.680 --> 17:07.319
Sounds like you're rich.

17:07.960 --> 17:09.920
But I think Jinzhao is better.

17:10.839 --> 17:13.240
If I meet those Qiyuan disciples

17:13.240 --> 17:14.880
again,

17:15.240 --> 17:18.000
will they bow and kneel to me?

17:18.839 --> 17:19.520
That's great.

17:20.560 --> 17:21.720
You must not give it away.

17:22.200 --> 17:23.000
You need to order them

17:23.000 --> 17:24.440
to give their treasures

17:24.440 --> 17:25.480
to us.

17:25.760 --> 17:28.160
Good idea. We'll get rich.

17:28.480 --> 17:29.600
Once we become rich,

17:29.840 --> 17:30.720
we will have noodles

17:30.960 --> 17:32.920
with ten eggs.

17:34.560 --> 17:35.640
Good for you.

17:35.640 --> 17:36.320
So,

17:36.320 --> 17:38.440
can you give me the money you got

17:38.800 --> 17:40.720
in Fujin Hall in advance?

17:43.360 --> 17:44.120
I'm not that stupid.

17:44.920 --> 17:45.640
Let's talk business.

17:47.040 --> 17:47.480
Alright.

17:49.040 --> 17:50.400
We've been searching for our origins.

17:51.120 --> 17:53.440
We found such a clear clue
for the first time.

17:53.640 --> 17:54.160
Yes.

17:54.560 --> 17:56.640
So I'm very flustered now.

17:57.280 --> 17:58.200
It means

17:58.720 --> 18:01.800
my left eye's premonition was accurate.

18:02.320 --> 18:03.680
As long as we follow Luo Zhaoyan,

18:03.840 --> 18:05.240
we will definitely find more clues.

18:05.600 --> 18:07.680
Exactly. We will follow him from now on.

18:08.040 --> 18:10.040
No matter where he goes,

18:10.760 --> 18:13.280
keep a close eye on him.

18:13.600 --> 18:14.160
Good.

18:16.320 --> 18:17.200
So you're saying

18:18.240 --> 18:20.800
Yue Qi is suspected to be Lord Ming.

18:21.760 --> 18:24.360
And she behaved differently from others.

18:26.600 --> 18:27.240
Zhaoyan.

18:27.760 --> 18:30.000
Their experiences are strange.

18:30.480 --> 18:32.160
Why not let them go back with you

18:32.600 --> 18:33.640
and investigate them?

18:34.440 --> 18:34.760
Okay.

18:35.240 --> 18:36.720
Then I will take them back with me.

18:38.720 --> 18:40.400
Maiming, have an early rest.

18:41.440 --> 18:42.040
Zhaoyan.

18:43.560 --> 18:45.040
Anything else?

18:47.440 --> 18:48.560
I'm well.

18:48.840 --> 18:49.520
Don't worry.

18:52.800 --> 18:53.320
Cang Feng.

18:54.600 --> 18:55.720
Before Zhaoyan returns,

18:56.960 --> 19:00.120
I want to know all
about the siblings' past.

19:00.120 --> 19:00.520
Yes.

19:05.520 --> 19:06.160
- Jinzhao.
- Qi.

19:06.560 --> 19:07.560
I have something important

19:07.560 --> 19:09.520
to tell you.

19:10.120 --> 19:10.760
What is it?

19:14.560 --> 19:15.800
In another hour,

19:16.640 --> 19:18.120
our birthday will be over.

19:22.080 --> 19:22.600
This is…

19:23.280 --> 19:24.160
Your birthday gift.

19:26.000 --> 19:26.320
Well…

19:32.720 --> 19:34.920
You bought this white one.

19:36.040 --> 19:36.600
Wait.

19:38.440 --> 19:38.880
What's wrong?

19:45.080 --> 19:46.120
You already bought one?

19:46.960 --> 19:47.720
Give it back to me.

19:48.440 --> 19:50.360
You have given it to me.

19:50.560 --> 19:51.960
You can't take it back.

19:53.440 --> 19:54.360
As for this,

19:54.600 --> 19:56.280
originally I bought it for myself.

19:56.360 --> 19:59.040
Seeing that you saved me,

19:59.080 --> 20:00.680
I'll give it to you as a birthday gift.

20:01.840 --> 20:03.600
What a surprise.

20:04.080 --> 20:06.080
I used to give you birthday presents.

20:06.840 --> 20:08.520
This is your first time.

20:09.160 --> 20:10.680
Since when did you learn
to care for others?

20:11.920 --> 20:13.160
If you don't want it, give it back.

20:13.400 --> 20:14.880
You have given it to me.

20:15.000 --> 20:15.760
Don't ask for it back.

20:15.880 --> 20:16.400
Give it to me.

20:18.800 --> 20:20.720
Wait, look.

20:27.280 --> 20:29.840
These two seem to be a pair.

20:44.840 --> 20:45.440
Right?

21:05.640 --> 21:06.960
Jinzhao.

21:08.120 --> 21:10.040
He lied to me about my birthday gift.

21:15.800 --> 21:17.200
Will he expect me

21:17.200 --> 21:19.360
to give all the tasty food to him?

21:24.560 --> 21:25.200
Anyway,

21:25.360 --> 21:27.160
he got me a birthday gift.

21:27.480 --> 21:29.080
I'm okay with that.

21:41.920 --> 21:43.040
What is this?

21:47.680 --> 21:49.280
(Is it an illusion?)

22:13.800 --> 22:14.880
Alright, move it away.

22:15.280 --> 22:15.680
Yes.

22:19.920 --> 22:21.680
Luo, what is this?

22:23.480 --> 22:23.960
You two,

22:24.520 --> 22:26.400
this is Mr. Luo,
the steward of my trade house.

22:29.680 --> 22:30.520
I'm having him

22:30.680 --> 22:32.800
return the treasures seized
from Fujin Hall

22:33.080 --> 22:33.720
to their owners.

22:40.280 --> 22:40.640
What?

22:41.360 --> 22:44.200
Jinzhao, yesterday at Fujin Hall,

22:44.200 --> 22:45.920
you picked up bank notes.

22:46.520 --> 22:47.880
Are they stolen goods?

22:55.880 --> 22:57.240
I almost forgot.

22:57.520 --> 22:58.600
Thank you for reminding me.

22:59.440 --> 23:00.400
It's what I got yesterday.

23:04.200 --> 23:05.880
You're a man of integrity.

23:06.280 --> 23:07.600
A great man.

23:20.640 --> 23:21.360
Thank you, Master.

23:21.360 --> 23:23.080
Thank you, young man.

23:23.120 --> 23:24.000
Master, no worries.

23:24.360 --> 23:26.480
I will do a good job.

23:27.200 --> 23:28.640
I shall take my leave.

23:28.760 --> 23:29.160
Good.

23:38.000 --> 23:38.600
Let's go.

23:40.280 --> 23:42.120
Are you taking us to your home?

23:42.200 --> 23:42.560
Yes.

23:43.880 --> 23:44.840
That's great.

23:45.000 --> 23:48.360
I've heard it's a picturesque place.

23:48.840 --> 23:50.000
I've always wanted to visit it.

23:50.720 --> 23:51.720
Please wait a moment.

23:52.040 --> 23:53.200
The carriage will be here shortly.

23:53.280 --> 23:54.000
Guests.

23:54.520 --> 23:55.960
Sorry to interrupt.

23:56.200 --> 23:57.120
Here's your bill.

23:57.720 --> 23:59.360
Impossible.
The bill was settled yesterday.

23:59.920 --> 24:02.000
But this morning, you ordered fried eggs

24:02.000 --> 24:02.960
and tofu pudding.

24:03.680 --> 24:04.200
Look.

24:04.440 --> 24:05.320
And last night,

24:05.400 --> 24:06.680
you took two steamed buns.

24:07.440 --> 24:08.720
How could that be?

24:17.280 --> 24:18.120
It must be you,

24:18.120 --> 24:19.800
a silly, gluttonous fish.

24:20.200 --> 24:21.920
Who is silly?

24:21.920 --> 24:23.160
The one who ate them.

24:25.160 --> 24:26.160
You settle the bill yourself.

24:26.240 --> 24:26.960
Do you know why?

24:26.960 --> 24:28.040
Let me tell you.

24:28.040 --> 24:29.960
Because all my money is stolen goods.

24:30.840 --> 24:31.880
Miser!

24:33.640 --> 24:34.480
Put it to my account.

24:34.920 --> 24:35.520
Alright.

24:37.160 --> 24:38.640
You're so generous.

24:48.200 --> 24:49.380
(Yunlai Inn)

24:53.480 --> 24:54.680
Miss Yue.

25:03.340 --> 25:04.720
(Yunlai Inn)

25:05.280 --> 25:06.600
Stop, you two.

25:07.240 --> 25:08.880
I know you two are close.

25:09.240 --> 25:10.440
But how about letting me go first?

25:10.720 --> 25:11.360
No way.

25:13.880 --> 25:15.280
(You're so strange today.)

25:15.840 --> 25:17.080
(Wasn't it you who wanted me)

25:17.200 --> 25:18.200
(to get closer to Zhaoyan?)

25:18.720 --> 25:21.080
(Plans have changed. Just listen to me.)

25:23.160 --> 25:24.160
(I don't want to.)

25:25.280 --> 25:25.680
You hungry?

25:27.920 --> 25:29.400
Yes, I am.

25:33.760 --> 25:34.880
Delicious.

25:40.480 --> 25:41.520
(The sister is naive,)

25:42.360 --> 25:43.440
(but the brother is witty.)

25:44.000 --> 25:45.240
(I should be wary of Yue Jinzhao.)

25:45.840 --> 25:47.320
(Their identities are unclear.)

25:47.560 --> 25:49.520
(I need to investigate them carefully.)

25:49.760 --> 25:50.120
Let's go.

26:08.560 --> 26:10.720
Zhaoyan, does your home have tasty food?

26:10.920 --> 26:11.360
Yes.

26:12.480 --> 26:13.400
When we arrive,

26:13.440 --> 26:14.800
I'll have them make you egg noodles.

26:16.280 --> 26:17.120
Zhaoyan,

26:17.320 --> 26:19.400
how did you know I love egg noodles?

26:22.640 --> 26:23.400
I know.

26:23.680 --> 26:25.520
Zhaoyan, you must like me.

26:25.600 --> 26:28.000
The storybook says
if you blush while staring at someone,

26:28.000 --> 26:28.960
it means you like that guy.

26:29.760 --> 26:31.920
Miss Yue, don't mock me.

26:32.760 --> 26:33.160
Luo.

26:33.160 --> 26:34.960
Don't take it seriously.

26:37.880 --> 26:38.400
Luo.

26:39.200 --> 26:42.440
Do you know about the Qiyuan Orb?

26:43.920 --> 26:45.000
I've been tracking them.

26:45.440 --> 26:46.120
I do know about it.

26:47.320 --> 26:49.760
Can you tell us about it?

26:52.040 --> 26:53.800
When disciples join the Qiyuan sect,

26:54.120 --> 26:56.240
the directors in various places,
in the name of Lord Ming,

26:56.320 --> 26:57.880
will distribute Qiyuan Orbs to them.

26:58.840 --> 26:59.800
They cast spells

27:00.040 --> 27:02.240
to implant Qiyuan Orbs
into the bodies of the new disciples.

27:03.000 --> 27:03.600
At first,

27:04.160 --> 27:05.840
these disciples are strong and healthy,

27:06.560 --> 27:08.160
but over time,

27:08.640 --> 27:09.320
Qiyuan Orbs begin

27:09.320 --> 27:10.880
to absorb the force from their bodies.

27:11.520 --> 27:12.440
The soul fish is formed

27:12.680 --> 27:13.880
and stored within the Qiyuan Orbs.

27:15.280 --> 27:17.640
When the soul fish flies
out of the Qiyuan Orb,

27:18.840 --> 27:20.560
those disciples
will turn into stone statues.

27:22.240 --> 27:24.480
The Qiyuan Sect claims
they have ascended.

27:25.000 --> 27:27.440
So every Qiyuan Orb

27:28.160 --> 27:28.960
represents a human life.

27:35.000 --> 27:36.760
(I thought
the Qiyuan Sect just scammed money.)

27:37.800 --> 27:39.000
(I never expected it to kill men.)

27:40.280 --> 27:41.120
(I can't let it happen.)

27:45.240 --> 27:46.600
Moreover, I always feel

27:47.280 --> 27:48.440
that Qi and I

27:48.880 --> 27:50.680
were deliberately led to the Fujin Hall.

27:51.880 --> 27:53.200
Really?

27:53.720 --> 27:55.080
If Qi is the Lord Ming,

27:56.040 --> 27:57.360
how dare they hurt her?

28:01.120 --> 28:02.360
If the two of you are innocent,

28:02.600 --> 28:04.040
my family will not wrongly accuse you.

28:06.280 --> 28:08.200
You're a good Master of the Luo family.

28:08.440 --> 28:10.440
You're so righteous.

28:11.080 --> 28:12.120
A flatterer.

28:15.850 --> 28:17.220
(Jincui Oasis)

28:36.760 --> 28:37.320
Who is it?

29:13.580 --> 29:14.730
(Shuo Xuan, the princess of the Yu Clan)

29:44.800 --> 29:45.400
I'll kill you.

29:47.440 --> 29:49.400
Help.

29:50.160 --> 29:51.360
Help.

29:51.720 --> 29:53.120
Someone is calling for help.

30:00.280 --> 30:01.000
I will kill you.

30:04.240 --> 30:04.840
Don't.

30:10.640 --> 30:11.200
No.

30:11.320 --> 30:12.680
Miss, please believe me.

30:12.880 --> 30:13.960
I really didn't see anything.

30:13.960 --> 30:14.480
Shut up.

30:14.640 --> 30:15.960
How dare you.

30:16.000 --> 30:17.400
I will take out your eyes.

30:17.680 --> 30:18.200
I really…

30:18.360 --> 30:19.680
Miss, please stop.

30:19.760 --> 30:20.440
Help.

30:21.920 --> 30:24.000
Shifang, what happened?

30:25.000 --> 30:26.840
Master Luo.

30:27.400 --> 30:28.960
Zhaoyan, do you know him?

30:30.640 --> 30:31.560
Is that Qi?

30:32.480 --> 30:34.240
Master Luo, help!

30:34.240 --> 30:34.560
Out of here.

30:34.920 --> 30:36.520
Stay out of this,
or I will slaughter you all.

30:37.680 --> 30:38.920
Qi, pull him up first.

30:47.160 --> 30:47.600
Are you okay?

30:48.480 --> 30:50.840
Thank you for saving my life.

30:53.320 --> 30:56.480
(Yue Qi, you fool. Back off.)

30:59.480 --> 31:01.320
I must shoot you dead.

31:01.880 --> 31:03.320
(She seems to be hostile towards Qi.)

31:03.880 --> 31:04.600
(I need to test her.)

31:06.160 --> 31:07.840
You made this lady so mad.

31:08.040 --> 31:09.480
Because of you, Qi and I are blamed.

31:11.280 --> 31:12.840
Don't try to play dumb.

31:13.440 --> 31:15.200
(She is indeed sensitive to Qi.)

31:15.800 --> 31:16.720
(Does she know Qi?)

31:17.840 --> 31:18.640
So, what do you want?

31:19.200 --> 31:20.360
I must scratch his eyes out.

31:21.520 --> 31:22.080
Miss.

31:22.680 --> 31:24.560
Shifang made a mistake.

31:25.360 --> 31:27.560
He should suffer some pain.

31:28.000 --> 31:29.320
But there's no need to be so cruel

31:32.200 --> 31:34.000
Alright, you outnumber me.

31:35.200 --> 31:37.320
I'll spare your eyes for now.

31:39.920 --> 31:40.360
Hold on.

31:43.600 --> 31:44.240
Well…

31:45.040 --> 31:45.680
Well…

31:46.440 --> 31:47.800
I'm sorry.

31:50.120 --> 31:51.680
If you come within ten steps of me,

31:52.480 --> 31:54.400
I will make you disintegrate into ashes.

32:00.960 --> 32:01.800
She tried to hurt your eyes.

32:01.800 --> 32:02.720
You can't see her leave?

32:02.880 --> 32:04.400
You really fancy her?

32:06.000 --> 32:06.680
I don't.

32:07.160 --> 32:08.800
I don't.

32:08.800 --> 32:09.760
You're blushing.

32:10.800 --> 32:11.480
Shifang.

32:12.600 --> 32:14.000
You're not deceiving us, are you?

32:14.680 --> 32:18.040
I only saw a figure
in the middle of the river.

32:30.440 --> 32:31.560
Strange.

32:32.680 --> 32:34.640
I heard the iron poplar wood is nearby.

32:35.440 --> 32:37.040
Why haven't I seen it?

32:56.760 --> 32:59.000
Who is she?

32:59.560 --> 33:01.080
Is she a demon?

33:05.600 --> 33:06.280
Who is it?

33:13.080 --> 33:13.640
I swear

33:14.040 --> 33:15.680
I really didn't see anything.

33:15.680 --> 33:16.680
It's said in the storybook.

33:16.680 --> 33:18.680
You're blushing,
which means you like her.

33:18.800 --> 33:20.240
Do you like her?

33:23.840 --> 33:24.920
She's just joking with you.

33:25.520 --> 33:26.360
Let's go, Qi.

33:31.400 --> 33:31.960
Are you alright?

33:32.280 --> 33:32.760
I'm fine.

33:32.960 --> 33:33.280
Let's go.

33:33.360 --> 33:34.720
I was so scared just now.

33:40.760 --> 33:41.240
Shuo Xuan.

33:41.960 --> 33:43.960
How is Qi after she ate the Qiyuan Orb?

33:44.720 --> 33:45.760
His Lord is very concerned.

33:47.760 --> 33:49.560
Rest assured, she's doing well.

33:50.000 --> 33:51.040
She helped others deal with me.

33:52.560 --> 33:53.160
Calm down.

33:54.120 --> 33:56.120
I know when you came to check on Qi,

33:56.640 --> 33:57.400
the drought happened.

33:57.600 --> 33:58.280
You long for water.

33:58.400 --> 34:00.040
It's understandable to expose yourself.

34:00.680 --> 34:02.560
But His Lord gave you this mission.

34:03.000 --> 34:03.600
Be careful.

34:04.680 --> 34:05.720
It's all that fool's fault.

34:06.600 --> 34:07.440
Because of him,

34:08.239 --> 34:09.360
I am exposed so early.

34:10.560 --> 34:12.639
From now on, you follow Qi.

34:13.120 --> 34:14.239
You should be more careful.

34:14.719 --> 34:15.639
Don't get exposed again.

34:16.120 --> 34:17.560
I don't need your advice.

34:29.199 --> 34:29.800
Smells good.

34:31.960 --> 34:33.480
Jinzhao, is it done?

34:34.480 --> 34:34.920
Almost.

34:35.840 --> 34:37.719
Oh, right, allow me to introduce you.

34:38.560 --> 34:39.760
This is YYue Jinzhao.

34:40.480 --> 34:41.080
She's Yue Qi.

34:42.880 --> 34:44.280
(Ju Shifang, the head of Jiqiao Hall of the Zhengwu Alliance)
He's Ju Shifang

34:44.280 --> 34:45.440
from the Zhengwu Alliance.

34:46.960 --> 34:47.679
Zhengwu Alliance?

34:48.040 --> 34:49.040
Zhengwu Alliance works

34:50.199 --> 34:53.639
on eliminating demons and monsters.

34:53.920 --> 34:57.040
Though it's formed by various factions,

34:57.480 --> 35:00.240
each faction has its own system.

35:00.640 --> 35:03.880
In times of crisis,
the Alliance leader will give orders

35:04.040 --> 35:06.320
to fight against enemies together.

35:07.840 --> 35:10.080
Miss Yue is really familiar with us.

35:10.080 --> 35:10.600
Yes.

35:13.280 --> 35:15.240
I often hear of you from storytellers.

35:15.400 --> 35:17.160
I also know

35:17.400 --> 35:20.720
the Alliance includes Yongwu Hall,
Cloud Hall, and Jiqiao Hall.

35:21.240 --> 35:23.880
Which hall are you from?

35:25.200 --> 35:27.200
I am the head

35:27.800 --> 35:29.480
of the Jiqiao Hall.

35:30.560 --> 35:31.320
Really?

35:31.320 --> 35:32.440
So, you're a leader.

35:33.360 --> 35:34.120
No big deal.

35:34.440 --> 35:37.080
Thank you for your help again.

35:39.240 --> 35:42.000
You two share the surname Yue.

35:42.440 --> 35:44.480
I guess you are siblings.

35:45.560 --> 35:46.240
We just…

35:46.360 --> 35:47.120
It is done.

35:52.000 --> 35:52.600
Shifang,

35:54.080 --> 35:55.560
Jincui Oasis is far
from Zhengwu Alliance.

35:56.040 --> 35:57.240
Why are you here?

35:58.240 --> 35:59.920
I came to find the iron poplar wood.

36:00.240 --> 36:00.760
Jinzhao, here.

36:00.760 --> 36:02.080
I wanted to try my luck
at the Luo Mansion.

36:02.720 --> 36:04.760
The 50-year-old dried iron poplar wood

36:04.920 --> 36:07.280
is even lighter than a feather
and as tough as iron,

36:07.920 --> 36:10.000
making it more suitable
for creating mechanical contrivances.

36:12.000 --> 36:12.320
Oh,

36:15.480 --> 36:16.400
look.

36:21.840 --> 36:23.880
This iron poplar wood
is coarsely grained.

36:24.600 --> 36:26.840
It requires 20 percent of Yuqi Tree sap

36:27.040 --> 36:28.200
and 80 percent of the iron solution

36:28.360 --> 36:29.320
to be coated on it.

36:32.000 --> 36:33.240
It might be a bit difficult

36:33.280 --> 36:34.480
for you to understand.

36:35.240 --> 36:37.000
So, please take a look.

36:40.320 --> 36:41.200
So cute!

36:50.200 --> 36:51.120
It can move.

36:52.240 --> 36:53.840
It is quite cute.

36:55.720 --> 36:57.720
Its name is Dou Bao,
and it can even fight.

36:58.960 --> 37:00.080
Did you make it?

37:01.320 --> 37:03.520
My mother gave it to me
before she passed away,

37:03.680 --> 37:05.280
But I know mechanics too.

37:06.200 --> 37:07.560
But I'm not highly skilled yet.

37:09.480 --> 37:11.040
(Miss Yue looks so forthright.)

37:11.960 --> 37:13.160
(Is she related to the Qiyuan Sect?)

37:16.780 --> 37:18.950
(The Luo Mansion, famous protector)

37:19.820 --> 37:21.030
(Mist Soul)

37:21.030 --> 37:22.120
(Pureness)

37:23.120 --> 37:26.920
Pureness, Cold Marrow,
Mist Soul, Dragon Pool,

37:27.480 --> 37:31.120
Mirror, Flame Wave,
Poison Miasma, Chunzi,

37:32.520 --> 37:33.680
(Rehai)
and Rehai.

37:38.240 --> 37:41.960
(Luo Maiming, the guardian of Rehai)
Shennong feared that the Nine Springs

37:42.560 --> 37:44.720
would be misused,
so he made nine key rings

37:46.200 --> 37:47.680
and gave them to nine guardians

37:48.600 --> 37:50.400
to guard the Nine Springs.

37:51.760 --> 37:53.280
But has he ever considered the price

37:55.920 --> 37:59.280
that the guardians would have to pay?

38:23.110 --> 38:26.030
♪Looking back♪

38:27.150 --> 38:30.340
♪I try to bring back memories♪

38:31.240 --> 38:35.140
♪We're connected♪

38:35.140 --> 38:37.420
♪It's meant to be♪

38:39.020 --> 38:42.660
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

38:43.180 --> 38:46.990
♪Years leave no trace behind♪

38:46.990 --> 38:49.220
♪On a moonlight night♪

38:49.220 --> 38:51.210
♪I lapsed into my memory♪

38:51.210 --> 38:53.930
♪About you♪

38:53.930 --> 38:57.220
♪All laughter and joy is about you♪

38:57.930 --> 39:01.320
♪What is unforgettable is you♪

39:01.870 --> 39:03.720
♪The past glided before my mind♪

39:03.720 --> 39:05.960
♪I smiled and cried♪

39:05.960 --> 39:11.210
♪For happiness♪

39:11.210 --> 39:15.110
♪I went about the world looking for you♪

39:15.110 --> 39:19.210
♪All I have was the echo in the valley♪

39:19.210 --> 39:21.160
♪ In this tranquil world♪

39:21.160 --> 39:23.210
♪I've finally found you♪

39:23.210 --> 39:27.240
♪I'll spend the rest
of my life with you♪

39:27.240 --> 39:30.980
♪I've been looking for you♪

39:30.980 --> 39:35.110
♪I wish to share joy
and sorrow with you♪

39:35.950 --> 39:37.380
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

39:37.380 --> 39:39.660
♪I engrave your name♪

39:39.660 --> 39:45.670
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪

40:01.200 --> 40:04.200
♪Wind rises and rain ceases♪

40:05.160 --> 40:08.330
♪During the long-lost quiet time♪

40:09.160 --> 40:13.100
♪Both of us get closer♪

40:13.100 --> 40:15.240
♪And watch the stars♪

40:17.000 --> 40:20.170
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

40:21.130 --> 40:24.300
♪Stories leave no trace behind♪

40:24.300 --> 40:27.050
♪On a moonlight night♪

40:27.050 --> 40:29.190
♪I lapsed into my memory♪

40:29.190 --> 40:31.850
♪About you♪

40:31.850 --> 40:35.430
♪All laughter and joy is about you♪

40:35.980 --> 40:37.380
♪It's unforgettable♪

40:37.380 --> 40:39.340
♪It's all about you♪

40:39.950 --> 40:42.220
♪The past glided before my mind♪

40:42.220 --> 40:43.910
♪I smiled and cried♪

40:43.910 --> 40:49.000
♪For happiness♪

40:49.000 --> 40:52.940
♪I went about the world looking for you♪

40:52.940 --> 40:56.940
♪All I have was the echo in the valley♪

40:56.940 --> 40:59.180
♪ In this tranquil world♪

40:59.180 --> 41:01.160
♪I've finally found you♪

41:01.160 --> 41:05.190
♪I'll spend the rest
of my life with you♪

41:05.190 --> 41:09.130
♪I've been looking for you♪

41:09.130 --> 41:13.350
♪I wish to share joy
and sorrow with you♪

41:13.350 --> 41:15.370
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

41:15.370 --> 41:17.740
♪I engrave your name♪

41:17.740 --> 41:23.850
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪
